B.c1_=new A.ce(B.h7,["General","Emergency & Maintenance","What counts as an emergency maintenance request?","Active water leaks, no heat in winter, gas smells, fire hazards, or total power loss. Submit an urgent request with photos/video and call emergency dispatch."],t.o)
B.c15=new A.ce(B.h7,["Property","Parking & Access","Where can tenants and visitors park?","Assigned tenant spots are numbered. Visitor parking is available in designated guest spaces for up to 48 hours."],t.o)
B.c14=new A.ce(B.h7,["Property","Trash & Recycling","When is garbage and recycling collection day?","Bins are collected every Tuesday and Friday morning. Please bag all trash and flatten cardboard boxes."],t.o)
