B.c19=new A.ce(B.h7,["Building","Community Rules","What are the building quiet hours?","Quiet hours are 10:00 PM \u2013 7:00 AM daily out of courtesy for all residents."],t.o)
B.c17=new A.ce(B.h7,["Unit","HVAC & Filters","What size HVAC air filter does this unit use?","16x25x1 MERV 8 pleated air filter in the hallway return grille. Replace every 90 days."],t.o)
B.c0Y=new A.ce(B.h7,["Unit","Shut-Off Valves","Where are the main water shut-off valve and breaker panel?","The main water shut-off valve is under the kitchen sink / utility closet. The circuit breaker panel is in the hallway closet."],t.o)
